## The generator that wrote lines 11-199 (2026-10-29)

- File name gen_dtor_tbl.py, sha256 14fe15ed7db69cc48ebbad20adb7aa6b5df6c56f7464b2ae65adf4b15e35cb51 (git blob
  2efbd5d860688aa8c5f6f4aa5401051773d96746). It is in no repository; its successor, the copy of record below, is.
  This is the one version of the file that was kept (last changed 2026-10-29 19:40Z). It wrote image B's table. Image
  A's table was already in a build at 19:21Z, so an earlier edit of the file wrote it; this version reproduces it byte
  for byte (below).
- Argument: IMAGE, the published image, under the file name fuzz_command.asan (the generator prints the file name). No
  slot arguments: its defaults START_SLOT 0xa7088 and STOP_SLOT 0xa7090 are image A's GOT words that asan.module_dtor
  reads.
- It prints to stdout the BEGIN line `(* BEGIN gen_dtor_tbl.py: generated by <the path it ran from> from`, line 12, the
  table, `(* END gen_dtor_tbl.py *)` and one line listing the odr indicators. The file holds the BEGIN line (path
  replaced), line 12, the table and the END line (reworded); the odr line is not in the file.
- Runtime: Python 3.12.3, pyelftools 0.33.

